  "2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,"Reviewed the complete all-status PM inventory, active goals, closed output/TOON/API lineage, relationship audit, official latest release, live server version, and sanitized format probes before creation; no duplicate repo-wide format-contract plan exists."
  "2026-08-05T20:51:50.696Z",codex,"Quality measurement: 978 portable tests passed with 1 intentional skip; coverage is statements 43.36%, branches 44.01%, functions 54.11%, lines 43.18%. The canonical coverage goal jf-mkzh remains open; this tranche improves the formatter boundary but does not claim repository-wide 100%."
  "2026-08-05T20:51:51.974Z",codex,Zero-duplication diagnostic remains red at 225 clones and 8.16% duplicated lines (8.00% tokens); canonical quality goal jf-lpki remains open. Bun audit and Trivy report zero vulnerabilities/secrets/misconfigurations; npm audit transport returned a registry endpoint error and will be retried.
  "2026-08-05T20:53:16.143Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,"PM telemetry is operational but transport is intermittent: the last successful flush was 2026-08-05T20:52:42Z; a subsequent explicit flush retained 4 queued events with fetch failed, and status then showed 6 queued events. This is an observability delivery limitation, not a product or tracker-integrity failure."
  "2026-08-05T21:20:05.997Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,"PR 52 first exact-head review: CodeRabbit produced five actionable findings after an initial quota warning; Sourcery skipped detailed review because the diff exceeded its 150000-character limit; Cubic and Sourcery checks skipped. All CodeRabbit findings were verified and fixed, including safe config-list projection, canonical system-info shape, structured setup errors, format semantics, AST alias detection, and force-flag docs."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,"Privacy boundary: credentials, server URL, user/server/item IDs, raw schemas, and payloads stay in environment variables or owner-only ~/.jellyfin-cli. PM and Git retain only public versions, commands, classifications, and aggregate outcomes."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:20:16.290Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,Resolving a format in createApiClient is insufficient when command handlers call TOON-specific renderers directly; format correctness must be enforced at the final output boundary.
