plan_decisions[3]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-08-05T20:28:20.201Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,Bind the legacy renderer method set to the resolved output format at createApiClient and prohibit direct TOON renderer use in command handlers.,"This preserves existing TOON normalization and minimizes behavior change while making the final serialization boundary authoritative for JSON, YAML, Markdown, table, and raw.","Source inventory, five sanitized live reproductions, and existing shared formatOutput/typed formatter contracts."
  "2026-08-05T21:20:04.561Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,"Accept all five CodeRabbit findings, including the already-resolved documentation correction; preserve JSON server-list arrays and canonical system-info fields, format pre-client failures, and strengthen semantic and AST contracts.",Each finding reproduced against the exact PR head; config list also needed secret-safe projection before using the shared formatter.,PR 52 review 4868807502 and threads PRRT_kwDORbJJhM6WyvJr through PRRT_kwDORbJJhM6WyvKL.
  "2026-08-05T21:29:48.682Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,Encode the only legitimate hard-coded TOON and direct JSON output exceptions as exact AST counts.,schema-utils and schema-validate each need one TOON fallback for an invalid requested format; events needs exactly two JSON.stringify writes for its documented NDJSON stream. Any added or removed exception now fails the guard.,CodeRabbit inline verification comment 3724157214 and repository AST inventory.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T20:28:18.488Z",codex-jellyfin-format-20260805,"Static inventory found 291 direct TOON renderer calls across 45 command modules despite 368 createApiClient format resolutions; live JSON parsing failed for artists, playlists, libraries, and genres while the server remained read-only."
